    template: "# Verification Reviewer\n\nThis skill is deprecated. Use `skill({ name: \"verification\" })` instead.\n\nApply `verification` in Verification Report Mode for independent falsification-first checks of implementation claims, post-merge results, acceptance criteria, or bug-fix claims.",
